{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/5e91101892e6d0cb5e302bfca739493e.poster.avif?t=1769491713\" width=780 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/5e91101892e6d0cb5e302bfca739493e.webm?t=1769491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Rosegate, a thriving medieval metropolis where treachery lurks around every corner. In this city of power and peril, the strong survive, and the weak perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Duvessa Devereux\u2014 a noblewoman and pale-skinned beauty, driven by insatiable lust for power and existential ennui. Scheme, seduce, or destroy your way to the top of Rosegate\u2019s food chain as you navigate a web of ambition and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/afc7936ec2c74c1ef5e1979debf92594.poster.avif?t=1769491713\" width=780 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/afc7936ec2c74c1ef5e1979debf92594.webm?t=1769491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be a political mastermind, bending the kingdom to your will? Or will your arrogance lead to defeat? With RPG elements and branching choices, Jezebel lets you shape your Duvessa\u2019s story. Play as the ultimate femme fatale\u2014 or as an overconfident fool.. In Rosegate, noble life is a zero-sum game. The question is: will you rule, or will you submit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/5266766e1087be095ba594ac77067ebc.poster.avif?t=1769491713\" width=780 height=708 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/5266766e1087be095ba594ac77067ebc.webm?t=1769491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/41e73a162080fd12cc8f23f511cd8a5a.poster.avif?t=1769491713\" width=780 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/41e73a162080fd12cc8f23f511cd8a5a.webm?t=1769491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A literary storyline</strong> filled with warring factions, betrayal, conspiracy, romance, and themes of existential philosophy and ideology.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A scene-stealing Byronic heroine</strong>\u2014the kind you\u2019ll love to hate or hate to love.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A branching narrative</strong> shaped by your choices and a unique system that reflects your playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich worldbuilding</strong> with an in-game encyclopedia to deepen your immersion in Rosegate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An original soundtrack</strong> (OST) that expands with each episode.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-running, episodic storytelling</strong> with updates that keep the intrigue alive.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045080?t=1769491713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/c748051c1e9a4bfe92f8269d440939dc0906dd60/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769491713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/c82f914d170dfc9294b92e8945c1598cde9b18f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769491713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/c82f914d170dfc9294b92e8945c1598cde9b18f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769491713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4334010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/5e91101892e6d0cb5e302bfca739493e.poster.avif?t=1769491713\" width=780 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045080/extras/5e91101892e6d0cb5e302bfca739493e.webm?t=1769491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Rosegate, a thriving medieval metropolis where treachery lurks around every corner. In this city of power and peril, the strong survive, and the weak perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Duvessa Devereux\u2014 a noblewoman and pale-skinned beauty, driven by insatiable lust for power and existential ennui. Scheme, seduce, or destroy your way to the top of Rosegate\u2019s food chain as you navigate a web of ambition and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p c